BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    asure, however, the warmth would grow, binding them in an eternal dance of abundance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  Aethel cast his embers, trusting in the potential of the void. Vora caught the radiance, saw t) Tj ET
