BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (  In the beginning, the world was a barren expanse. Two spirits lived on opposite sides of the r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    iver. The Giver held five silver seeds, small and inert. He tossed them into the rushing cur) Tj ET
