BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      In the beginning, the Weaver and the Harvester stood on opposite banks of a wide, silent r) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        iver. The Harvester held a handful of golden seeds, but the soil on his side was cracked) Tj ET
