BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        erous portion to the Harvester. With these threads, the Harvester stitched a bridge acro) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        ss the river, uniting them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
