BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        f that bond. They ceased to measure the weight of the crystal and instead measured the i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        ntensity of the glow they created together. In the silent depths of the earth, they lear) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        ned that the echo of a gift returned is the only thing that keeps the world from silence) Tj ET
