BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      Myth: The loom of the cosmos required two hands to operate, one to feed the warp and one t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (        o weave the weft. As Elara stood at the frame, she recognized that holding onto the gold) Tj ET
